<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112880" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωτεινός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῶς</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shining, bright,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥλιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					4.3.4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοτεινὰ καὶ φ. [σώματα</span>]
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.10.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				17.31
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2
			</span></i>. 
			<i><span class="en">
				1110b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				<u>in CA</u>
				26p.478M.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.Med.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				9.5.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴκημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					2.10
				</span></i>
			, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>clear, distinct,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.9b
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			, s.v.l.); also in moral sense, <i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				<u>in CA</u>
				3p.424M.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν ὁ ὀφθαλμός σου ἁπλοῦς ᾖ, καὶ
					ὅλον τὸ σῶμά σου φ. ἐστιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					11.34
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				36
			</span></i>.</div>
